  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_5049.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Tras una jornada dedicada &iacute;ntegramente a la infancia, la noche de este mi&eacute;rcoles el barrio de San Joaqu&iacute;n, en Onda, se ha visto animado por el divertido pasacalle de disfraces, antes de la discom&oacute;vil y la fiesta de la espuma. Este jueves vuelven los toros, con&nbsp;exhibici&oacute;n y embolada&nbsp; del toro Pele&oacute;n, n&ordm;40 G 9 de la ganader&iacute;a de Torrealta, y de la vaca de las mujeres.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5048.jpg\" alt=\"img_5048\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5049.jpg\" alt=\"img_5049\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5050.jpg\" alt=\"img_5050\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5051.jpg\" alt=\"img_5051\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5052.jpg\" alt=\"img_5052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5053.jpg\" alt=\"img_5053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5054.jpg\" alt=\"img_5054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantjoaquim13/img_5055.jpg\" alt=\"img_5055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a97